msgctxt "460\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at the Poppo on Tenkaichi St. and are\nnow allies with the manager."
msgstr "Te convertiste en un cliente habitual del Poppo de la calle Tenkaichi y\nahora te has aliado con el gerente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "557\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at M Store and are now allies with\nthe manager."
msgstr "Te convertiste en un cliente habitual de la M Store y ahora te has\naliado con el gerente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "635\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You gave alcohol to the homeless man in front of West Park and are\nnow allies with him."
msgstr "Le diste alcohol al vagabundo que estaba frente al parque oeste y\nahora te has aliado con él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "723\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at Cuez Bar and are now allies with\nthe bartender."
msgstr "Te convertiste en un cliente habitual del Bar Cuez y ahora te has\naliado con el barman."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "804\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You used the taxi frequently and are now allies with a driver\nat the north end of the Hotel District."
msgstr "Usaste el taxi con frecuencia y ahora eres aliado de un\nconductor que está en el norte del distrito hotelero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "906\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at Asia and are now allies with the\nemployee there."
msgstr "Te convertiste en un cliente habitual del Club Asia y ahora eres\naliado de los empleados del lugar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "988\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at Earth Angel and are now allies\nwith the mama."
msgstr "Te convertiste en un cliente habitual del Ángel Terrenal y ahora\neres aliado de la mama."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1067\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You played Boxcelios 2 frequently and are now allies with a\nClub SEGA employee."
msgstr "Jugaste Boxcelios 2 con frecuencia y ahora eres aliado\nde un empleado del Club SEGA."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1147\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at Kotobuki Drugs and are now allies\nwith the employee there."
msgstr "Te convertiste en un cliente habitual de Farmacias Kotobuki y\nahora te has aliado con los empleados del lugar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1239\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at Café Alps and are now allies\nwith an employee there."
msgstr "Te convertiste en cliente habitual del Café Alps y ahora te has\naliado con el empleado del lugar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1326\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You gave a drink to the homeless man in Theater Square and are now\nallies with him."
msgstr "Le diste una bebida al vagabundo que estaba en la Plaza del Teatro\ny ahora te has aliado con él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1410\tEXPLANATION"
msgid "You became a regular customer at Kyushu No. 1 Star and are now\nallies with the owner."
msgstr "Te convertiste en un cliente habitual de Kyushu Estrella N° 1 y\nahora te has aliado con el dueño."

